# CLI and TUI

CLI: every input is a flag or stdin. Missing values fail immediately with a correct example. `--help` on every subcommand includes Examples. `--json` on ask/status/doctor/sessions. stdout is data; stderr is progress.

```text
# ❌ BAD
tny ask
? Select backend (use arrow keys)

# ✅ GOOD
tny --backend openai ask --json "summarize src/"
```

TUI: ANSI shell (transcript + composer + footer). No ncurses. `/` `@` `$` palettes; disable them during approvals. Esc/Ctrl-C interrupts a turn.

Do not initialize a backend until the user submits a turn, except `doctor`.
